---
import InfoPage from '../components/InfoPage.astro';
---

<InfoPage
	title="Contact"
	description="Contact ToolPulse about feedback, bugs, privacy questions, or tool suggestions."
	canonicalPath="/contact"
>
	<h2>Get in touch</h2>
	<p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@toolpulse.app">hello@toolpulse.app</a> for product feedback, bug reports, privacy questions, or suggestions for useful new tools.</p>

	<h2>Reporting a problem</h2>
	<p>Include the tool name, the browser and device you used, what you expected, and what happened. Do not include passwords, access tokens, confidential files, or other sensitive data.</p>

	<h2>Response expectations</h2>
	<p>ToolPulse is a growing project. Messages are reviewed as capacity allows, but a specific response time cannot be guaranteed.</p>
</InfoPage>
